# Battle against Shaymin (the Gratitude Pokémon of the flower fields): a springy F-major accordion tune in dotted
# skips, a flute singing above it and a tuba and guitar keeping a bouncing two-step. Original composition for this
# game.
title Battle! Shaymin
tempo 168
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.07
reverb 0.24

